    "bio": "Asitha Fernando is a Sri Lankan right-arm medium-fast bowler who made his Test debut on January 3, 2021, against South Africa. Born on July 31, 1997, in Katuneriya, Sri Lanka, he has emerged as a key figure in Sri Lanka's pace attack across all formats. Fernando is known for his ability to generate movement with the new ball and his effective reverse swing with the old ball. He achieved his first ten-wicket haul in Test cricket in May 2022 against Bangladesh."
